<title>USA: Fort Collins, Colo., repriced, top yield unchanged.</title>
<headline>Fort Collins, Colo., repriced, top yield unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Edwards &amp; Sons Inc said Tuesday it repriced Fort Collins, Colo.'s $13.8 million wastewater utility bond issue, adjusting yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2005 unchanged at approximately 5.085 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>CITY OF FORT COLLINS, COLORADO,</p>
<p>RE: $13,780,000*</p>
<p>WASTEWATER UTILITY ENTERPRISE</p>
<p>SEWER REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS SERIES 1996A</p>
<p>SEE REPRICING IN 1997 &amp; 1999-2003.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD RECEIVED</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>		 (FSA INSURED)	    (FSA INSURED)</p>
<p>    DATED: 09/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1996</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON	 PRICE</p>
<p>12/01/1996		  330M    3.625 %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/1997		1,485M    4.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/1998		1,460M    4.30  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/1999		1,460M    4.50  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/2000		1,620M    4.55  %	  4.625</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.712)</p>
<p>12/01/2001		1,675M    4.625 %	  4.75</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.426)</p>
<p>12/01/2002		1,750M    4.75  %	  4.85</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.465)</p>
<p>12/01/2003		1,715M    4.80  %	 99.25</p>
<p>						  (Approx. Yield 4.924)</p>
<p>12/01/2004		1,805M    5.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/2005		  480M    5.00  %	 99.375</p>
<p>						  (Approx. Yield 5.085)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 12/01/2003    100.00</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, September 11, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>Piper, Jaffray Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
